Actually, the applet I gave you the link for has the formula. It's not
as simple as you would expect because there's also a random surcharge or
abatement part of the calculation. For your convenience here's the cost
calculation copied from the applet where you find the charisma part.

     if (price == 0)
         price = 5

     if (surcharge)
         price += Math.floor (price / 3)    // 133%

     if (bad_conditions())
         price += Math.floor (price / 3)    // 133%

          if (cha >= 19)   price  = Math.floor (price / 2)    //  50%
     else if (cha >= 18)   price -= Math.floor (price / 3)    //  67%
     else if (cha >= 16)   price -= Math.floor (price / 4)    //  75%
     else if (cha <   6)   price *= 2                         // 200%
     else if (cha <   8)   price += Math.floor (price / 2)    // 150%
     else if (cha <  11)   price += Math.floor (price / 3)    // 133%

     if (price <= 0)
         price = 1


